    "title": "Cigar Industry Report: Edition 708 (9/26/26) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By William Cooper ,\n21 hours ago We have our final giveaway from Procigar 2026, a 12-cigar sampler and lighter/v-cutter. We got the details here. Fuente for Heroes Fundraiser (w/ Smoke Inn) Smoke Inn and KMA Talk Radio in conjunction with Cigar Coop has launched the Fuente for Heroes Fundraiser. We are proud to support the Tunnel to Towers Foundation by bringing together extraordinary, rare, and highly collectible Arturo Fuente pieces for the cigar community. These are items that are exceptionally difficult—if not nearly impossible—to find or purchase. Yet through a simple donation to an incredible cause, you will have the opportunity to earn entries for a raffle to receive one of these remarkable pieces. 100% of every donation goes to Tunnel to Towers, helping support America’s fallen and catastrophically injured military heroes, first responders, and their families. We got the details here. Read full article",
    "summary": "Fuente for Heroes Fundraiser (w/ Smoke Inn) Smoke Inn and KMA Talk Radio in conjunction with Cigar Coop has launched the Fuente for Heroes Fundraiser. We are proud to support the Tunnel to Towers Foundation by bringing together extraordinary, rare, and highly collectible Arturo Fuente pieces for the cigar community. These are items that are exceptionally difficult—if not nearly impossible—to find or purchase. Yet through a simple donation to an incredible cause, you will have the opportunity to earn entries for a raffle to receive one of these remarkable pieces.",
